Supplementary figures
SCIENTIFIC_FIGURE

Multi-panel scientific figure combining dataset summary plots, categorical pie charts, cell-type comparison heatmaps, and a model/workflow architecture diagram.

Panel **a** shows stacked bar charts of cell counts in millions. One chart is grouped by omics modality **RNA, ATAC, Spatial** with species legend **Human, Mouse, Macaque, Marmoset**; another is grouped by species **Human, Mouse, Macaque, Marmoset** with omics legend **RNA, ATAC, Spatial**. Total shown is **129.6M** cells, with Spatial and macaque/human categories visually contributing large fractions.

Panel **b** contains pie charts for metadata distributions: **Disease**, **Region**, and **Development stage**. Disease includes Normal, Neurodegeneration, Brain Tumors, Epilepsy, Immune disorders, Cognitive impairment, Psychiatric, and Other. Region is dominated by **Subcortex 67.1%**, with other labeled cortical and subcortical areas. Development stage includes Adult, Elderly, fetal trimesters, Infancy, and Adolescence.

