- **Panel e:** Side-by-side method comparison including **scMOBA label, scMOBA pseudolabel, scGPT, Geneformer, Harmony, RPCA, CCA, FastMNN, scVI**, with top row colored by broad cell type and bottom row by modality.

Main visible finding: embeddings differ strongly by method; scGPT and some conventional integration methods show clearer mixing of modalities/species or separation of biological cell types, while other methods show stronger modality or dataset-driven clustering.
