Learning objective for pretraining
The objective of scMOBA pretraining is to generate accurate textual responses conditioned on both the gene expression input and the text-formatted question.
During pretraining, the model is trained in an autoregressive manner, where the large language model predicts the next token given the preceding tokens and multimodal context. The overall loss function is defined as the standard language modeling loss over all tokens in the answer sequence:
